# tests/
This directory contains the ledger package’s test coverage, focused entirely on verifying core parsing, categorisation, reporting, formatting, and validation behaviour.

`test_ledger.py` exercises amount and transaction-line parsing using representative inputs, ensuring the ledger interprets source data correctly and rejects invalid cases through the expected `LedgerError` exceptions.

The tests also cover rule-based categorisation, category and monthly reports, and output formatting. Together, they check both ordinary results and error paths, making this file the main reference for the package’s intended behaviour and a useful place to look when changing ledger rules, reports, or validation.
